 GXRuntime/graphics/aurora/lib/webgpu/gpu.cpp  |  11 +-
 .../graphics/aurora/lib/webgpu/gpu_prof.cpp   | 119 +++++++++++++++---
 .../graphics/aurora/lib/webgpu/gpu_prof.hpp   |   5 +
 4 files changed, 124 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

